{
  "name": "all_pairs_gap_bandpass_clip_v1",
  "intuition": "Reweight all improving pairs using a bandpass weighting that highlights pairs with gaps within a configurable range, suppressing very small and very large gaps via clamping; preserves all-pairs topology and introduces a new gap filtering paradigm.",
